# r1113 chunk 2, boot c2a1: every group-A row of the chunk that needs no config edit (cooking stations, jams, Barbeque's
# Delight, cutting boards, carve and dependency checks on the current jars, Large Meals / Roll / BBQ changes).
# World group A (superflat creative; ground top y -61, stand at -60). Level name: c2a1.
# Setup before boot (server stopped):
#   prep_srv.sh OUT c2a1 A spawn-animals=true
#   cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/c2_probe.js  OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_c2_probe.js    (new, /zc2)
#   cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/zp_probe.js  OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_zp_probe.js    (/zp sneak, eat, hunger, effects, inv)
#   cp $INST/tools/scratch_query/zact_probe.js OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/zz_zact_probe.js (/zact kill, break)
#   (zq is copied by prep_srv.sh). No config edits. perfBot jar comes with prep_srv.sh (bot c2b).
# Id fixes against the row text (namespaces moved 11-09/11-10; details in c2_triage.md): fdcooking/ -> farmersdelightcooking/,
#   creativeengineering:oven -> creativedelight:oven, vintagedelight:mason_jar -> empty_mason_jar, creativeengineering:
#   tags -> creativeequipment: / creativedelight:, flint_and_terrasteel -> creativemagic:, plate_block_iron ->
#   aluminum_plate_block, shulker filet input ends_delight:shulker_meat.
# Order: rows that read logs/kubejs/server.log come before SQ-BBQ2-01 (its /reload truncates that file).
# Layout: bot c2b at 300 -60 296; CFS z 310, STN-01 z 320, STN-02 z 330, STN-03/-06/-07 z 340, BBQS z 350, CBW z 360,
#   BBQW z 370, DEP-05 campfires x 330 z 300, kills / breaks x 340-350.
# Not here (c2_triage.md): SQ-TSY-01/-02, SQ-CEQ-03, -06 (client), SQ-CMG-02, SQ-CEN-02, -05, SQ-CFR-03/-04 (legacy
#   config boots c2_l1*.qb, c2_l2.qb), SQ-DEP-02 (c2_nobrew.qb).
pace 1

## SQ-C2-00 | setup: area, gamerules, bot (not a test row)
> forceload add 296 290 360 380
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> gamerule doWeatherCycle false
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 3
> time set noon
> weather clear
> pbot spawn c2b 300 -60 296 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> clear c2b
> zp inv c2b
waitlog \[zp\] done 20
reject \[zc2\] error|\[zp\] error

